share: .4
rate: 1
# rate lowered (drafts/repeats/everyday.py)
scene: The ceremony is set for the spring: months of classes, words to learn by heart, and the whole family coming to watch.
scene W: {N} will stand up in front of everyone and make a promise. {parent} says it is the day a child becomes a full member.
scene U: {N} has questions the classes never quite answer, and pages of old words to learn before spring.
scene B: Relatives are coming from all over, and every one of them will bring an envelope. {N} counts heads.
scene R: {N} keeps picturing it: standing up in front of everyone, heart going, voice shaking, the whole room watching.
scene G: {grandparent} went through the same ceremony, in the same building, at the same age. The old photograph hangs in the hall.
