scene U: {mentor} lends {N} a book that is far too hard and says to come back with questions. {N} reads it twice.
scene B: Someone with influence is on {Ns} side now. {N} begins to see what a word from {mentor} could open.
scene R: Nobody has ever said that to {N} before. {N} walks home grinning at strangers.
scene G: {mentor} says {N} has a gift. {N} has always felt it, the way a plant knows where the light is.
